  ┌─ Keys · lazyrunner v<version> ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Run                                                         View                                       │
  │   Space       Start / stop the focused app                    /           Search the focused app's ou… │
  │   u U         Start · focused / all                           z           Zoom the focused column      │
  │   s S         Stop · focused / all                            f           Filter the focused column b… │
  │   r R         Restart · focused / all                         + -         Widen / narrow the focused … │
  │   b B         Build · focused / all                           =           Equal column widths          │
  │   q           Quit                                            |           Layout: columns → next       │
  │ Tools                                                         Ctrl+L      Clear output                 │
  │   d           Switch database                                 Ctrl+R      Reload window                │
  │   i           Install packages: npm ci or npm install         t           Theme picker (Default)       │
  │   i c         npm ci                                        Help                                       │
  │   i n         npm install                                     ,           Settings (on/off toggles, r… │
  │   w W         Open in the browser · focused / all             ?           Key reference                │
  │   o           Open the focused app's log file                 :           Command palette              │
  │   y           Copy (yank)                                   Navigate                                   │
  │   D           Durations                                       h l Tab     focus another column         │
  │   H           Requests: what the .NET apps served             1-5         jump to a column             │
  │   M           Migrations: what's applied to the database      j k ↑ ↓     scroll a line                │
  │   T           Tests: run the project's test suites            ^u ^d ^b ^f half page / page (PgUp PgDn) │
  │   L           lazygit: git without leaving lazyrunner         gg G < >    oldest / follow new output   │
  │   x           Menu for the focused app                        n N Esc     search: older / newer / cle… │
  │ any key closes · : searches every command · lowercase = focused app, uppercase = all                   │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
